# Why extracted and not built from Mesa sources:
#   This tree builds Mesa 25.3.6 with -Dvulkan-drivers=[] (no Vulkan at all),
#   so a standalone Vulkan-Intel recipe cannot "just compile" from the same
#   tree without re-running the entire Mesa build with
#   -Dvulkan-drivers=intel,intel_hasvk. Arch already publishes exactly the two
#   files we need as a split package, so we consume those bytes (same pattern
#   the Lib32-* recipes use against Debian .debs).

